   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The days",
   "texto": [
    "The days are names, so they go with **mayúscula**, and they're all masculine. They carry **am**: **am Montag** (Monday).",
    "**Heute** = today. **Am Wochenende** = the weekend."
